1
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:10,700
Gemma, how do you feel about sport?

2
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,660
I’m not interested in sport.

3
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,780
I really don’t like it.

4
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:30,320
I mean, I like exercise so I go for walks and I like swimming, oh I run a lot too, that’s great – but I just don’t like sport, you know, the idea where you try to win, to beat other people.

5
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,145
And I hate sport on TV – I leave the room!

6
00:00:34,145 --> 00:00:44,020
And I don’t go to sports events like football matches – why do people pay so much money to watch 22 men run after a ball?

7
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:49,000
Andy, how do you feel about sport?

8
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,535
Well, I like running a lot.

9
00:00:53,040 --> 00:01:06,792
At school I play football but that’s because I have to, all the boys play football, and it’s OK, I mean I don’t hate it, but I don’t really like team games and sports very much.

10
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:14,480
I like doing things alone and I think that’s why I love running, it’s just me and not other people.

11
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:22,942
I’m not a very good runner but I just love trying to run a little faster than the last time, do you know what I mean?

12
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:28,060
Tracey, how do you feel about sport?

13
00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:32,680
Well, I absolutely love skateboarding, of course!

14
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:35,580
It’s just the best thing in the world.

15
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:41,180
Some of my family say it isn’t really a sport but they don’t know anything.

16
00:01:41,180 --> 00:01:44,080
I spend hours practising moves.

17
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:49,100
There’s a skate-park with a really good ramp, it’s not far from where I live.

18
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,880
I’m there all the time.

19
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,520
It’s the only sport I like really.

20
00:01:54,300 --> 00:02:01,162
I mean, I kind of like football but really that’s only because some of my friends are into it.

21
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:04,436
But skateboarding, that’s my thing.

22
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:09,240
Paul, how do you feel about sport?

23
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:13,800
When I was a kid I didn’t like any sports at all.

24
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:25,403
I thought: ‘I’m just not good at things like running and jumping’ but about a year ago I saw some gymnastics on TV and now I love it.

25
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:29,800
There’s a sports centre in my town where I can do gymnastics.

26
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:43,585
I can’t do it at school because they haven’t got anywhere, but I go to the sports centre every weekend and some evenings too, to do as much gymnastics as I can.

27
00:02:45,340 --> 00:02:48,260
Ryan, how do you feel about sport?

28
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:50,440
Sport? Wonderful!

29
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:53,267
I’m a real sports fanatic.

30
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:56,890
I mean, I think about sport all the time.

31
00:02:57,340 --> 00:03:03,520
I watch almost everything on TV – football, tennis, swimming, everything.

32
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:11,760
And I do a lot of sport too – my favourite’s football, of course, and I’m really not bad at football.

33
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:14,320
I’m in the school team too.

34
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:17,440
And I’m also learning to ski.

35
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:20,818
My family went to Italy last year.

36
00:03:21,421 --> 00:03:25,960
We went skiing – it was fantastic and I want to do more.
